#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:69
#: 285be318b80f445a9c4267e734ff6c7d
msgid ""
"Profile `defaults.ft.type`: `none` | `kwr75_485` | `kwr75_usb` (or left /"
" right). `end_effectors` / `ft` / `tcp_offset` all accept a symmetric key"
" that expands to both sides; a missing side falls back to the symmetric "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Profile 的 `defaults.ft.type`：`none` | `kwr75_485` | `kwr75_usb`（或 left / right）。`end_effectors` / `ft` / `tcp_offset` 都支持对称键并展开到左右；缺侧回退对称值。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:71
#: 675993be9ed746ddabf27b4fd76fef16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"TCP strings are evaluated **before** xacro (`${PI/2}`, `pi/2`, "
"`radians(90)`, numbers). Failed evaluation errors; they are not written "
"silently. Virtual tip also needs `left_ee_frame` / `right_ee_frame` in "
"`control.patch` (or controller params), e.g. `left_tcp_offset`."
msgstr ""
"TCP 字符串在写入 xacro **之前**求值（`${PI/2}`、`pi/2`、`radians(90)`、纯数字）。求值失败会报错，不会静默写入。选用虚拟 tip 时，还需在 `control.patch`（或控制器参数）中设置 `left_ee_frame` / `right_ee_frame`（例如 `left_tcp_offset`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:73
#: a41686af2d8e4dda92497cfd9d46a0a2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> \\"
"\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  ft:=kwr75_485 \\\n"
"  tcp_offset_rpy:=\"0 0 ${PI/2}\""
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  ft:=kwr75_485 \\\n"
"  tcp_offset_rpy:=\"0 0 ${PI/2}\""

